6. Complete the visual payout demo:
   - Create policy from MetaMask.
   - Backend writes matching `42 mm` mock data.
   - Backend approves settlement.
   - Anyone clicks “Verify & Payout.”
   - UI shows `Paid`.

7. Hackathon polish:
